{"id":"4894","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4894_main_polar-stratospheric-clouds-nacreous_special-clouds-and-other-features.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>珠母云或珍珠母云是一种主要由冰构成的极地平流层云。它们通常是波浪云，其特征是明亮的彩虹色，在黄昏时变得更加明亮。形成这种云的条件包括仅在冬季期间，世界高纬度地区的平流层中形成，且在低温的情况下。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© John Miles","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国约克Shipton by Beningbrough","latitude":"纬度: 54° 1' 23'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 8' 54'' W","date":"02 February 2016 0746 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4894_syn_polar-stratospheric-clouds-nacreous_special-clouds-and-other-features.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>一个较深厚的低压区域（966 hPa）位于英国苏格兰北部，在不列颠群岛上有强烈的西风气流。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4907_main_polar-stratospheric-clouds-nacreous_others-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>主要由冰构成的极地平流层云被珠母云或珍珠母云。如瑞典的这张照片所示，日落之后，它们的特点是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鲜艳的彩虹色</span>。</p>\n<p>在冬季，两个半球高纬度地区当温度低于冰霜点（通常接近-85°C）温度时，珠母云仅在平流层形成。它们通常是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状的</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Albert de Nijs","location":"瑞典利马NV","latitude":"纬度: 60° 56' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 13° 21' 44'' E","date":"22 December 2014 1634 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"}]}]}